{"id": "EUVD-2026-98932", "enisaUuid": "f8e89058-7954-3319-89cd-674af3783254", "description": "Jorani before 1.0.4 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the Hr controller's exportLeaves, exportOvertime and exportEmployees actions, allowing any authenticated user to export HR data. Attackers can request hr/exportEmployees or hr/exportLeaves/{id} and hr/exportOvertime/{id} to download employee names, emails, contracts, managers, and any employee's leave and overtime records.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T16:53:03", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T17:25:10", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/jorani/jorani/issues/426", "https://github.com/jorani/jorani/blob/v1.0.2/application/controllers/Hr.php#L459-L500", "https://github.com/jorani/jorani/commit/dee51fc3c6cb08b45fb2d03f3d44507bc07830e9", "https://github.com/jorani/jorani/releases/tag/v1.0.4", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jorani-before-1.0.4-missing-authorization-in-hr-export-actions"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-110099", "GHSA-cf27-x93f-gg54"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.25, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "15b22ac0-5e0e-3166-a9e4-a5f2910ef463", "product": {"name": "Jorani", "vendor": {"name": "Jorani"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.0.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "53196f53-0e23-3415-9a81-bb90e2d763a4", "vendor": {"name": "Jorani"}}], "isExploited": false}